                "source": "Twitter Web Client",
                "text": "\u274c MYTH: Tens of millions of Americans will lose Medicaid because of the One Big Beautiful Bill.\n\n\u2705 FACT: Under this bill, the only individuals who stand to lose Medicaid coverage over the next 10 years are the estimated 1.4 million illegal immigrants, 1.2 million individuals that do not qualify for Medicaid to begin with, and 4.8 million able-bodied individuals who choose not to meet community engagement requirements.",
