                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "The Affordable Care Act has failed to deliver on its core promise to lower costs.\n\nMy @HouseGOP colleagues and I are working on commonsense reforms to drive down costs, increase transparency, and put patients back in charge.\n\nRead my op-ed in @bistrib \u2b07\ufe0f\nhttps://t.co/nz5cjwcD8I",
