                "source": "Twitter Media Studio",
                "text": "According to @USCBO, @HouseGOP\u2019s Working Families Tax Cuts plan would have reduced health care premiums by 13%.\n\nBut @SenateDems fought hard to strip those policies out. \n\nWatch my thoughts on @FoxNews \u2b07\ufe0f https://t.co/rwb5NjGoX9",
