                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter Media Studio",
                "text": "Since 2021, health care premiums have increased 31% under the so-called \u201cAffordable Care Act.\u201d\n\nAnd the Democrats\u2019 solution? Throw more money at the program.  \n\n@HouseGOP is taking a different approach to lower costs. Watch: https://t.co/pCkL6aoNXm",
