                "retweet_count": 1,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "1. It creates \"Trump Health Freedom Accounts\" to put dollars directly in the hands of patients, instead of national insurance companies. \u00a0\n\nThese accounts can be used to pay insurance premiums or other qualified healthcare expenses.",
