                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 1,
                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Right now, insurance companies have no requirement to lower premiums with the taxpayer-funded subsidies they receive. That\u2019s why premiums are up 31% over the last four years.",
