                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "4. It will permanently codify @POTUS's hospital price transparency order, requiring hospitals to publicly disclose negotiated rates, cash prices, and cost-sharing information.\u00a0\u00a0\n\nThis will give Americans clear and upfront pricing when shopping for care.",
