                "retweet_count": 12,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "The Affordable Care Act left Americans with skyrocketing premiums & fewer options.\n\n@HouseGOP's Lower Health Care Premiums for All Americans Act gives working Americans a real path to affordable coverage with greater access, more choices, & lower costs.\u2b07\ufe0f\n\nhttps://t.co/rNC8u9hEaR",
