                "reply_count": 15,
                "retweet_count": 8,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "The Working Families Tax Cut plan established the Rural Health Transformation Fund, a landmark $50B investment in rural health care. After reviewing North Dakota\u2019s thoughtful application, @CMSGov just announced our state was awarded nearly $200M for our rural hospitals! \ud83c\udfe5",
                "text_lang": "en",
                "text_tagged_users": [
